        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>世界气候类型的分布</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    body {\n      color: #474747;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      padding-top: 47px;\n    }\n    .content {\n      width: 432px;\n      margin-left: 53px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 7px 1px;\n      color: #333;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 18px;\n    }\n    .intro {\n      width: 414px;\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      text-align: left;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .highlight {\n      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 35%, #efd1a7 35%, #efd1a7 91%, transparent 91%);\n    }\n    .gallery {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 193px 193px;\n      column-gap: 22px;\n      row-gap: 8px;\n      width: 408px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    figure {\n      width: 193px;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 193px;\n      height: 130px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .placeholder span {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .rainforest {\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 25% 30%, #304c32 0 12%, transparent 13%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 30%, #243d28 0 18%, transparent 19%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 82% 22%, #66885d 0 16%, transparent 17%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 35% 70%, #183322 0 25%, transparent 26%),\n        linear-gradient(115deg, #a2b3a7 0%, #637e67 35%, #153421 62%, #3b5835 100%);\n    }\n    .savanna {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, #5d91b4 0%, #96bdd2 38%, #d4a941 39%, #b5872c 70%, #756720 100%);\n    }\n    .savanna:before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 113px;\n      top: 25px;\n      width: 49px;\n      height: 16px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #435a30;\n      box-shadow: -25px 14px 0 -5px #40572d, 18px 10px 0 -7px #455f31;\n    }\n    .savanna:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 137px;\n      top: 37px;\n      width: 3px;\n      height: 48px;\n      background: #4e4221;\n      transform: rotate(4deg);\n    }\n    .forest {\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(94deg, transparent 0 12px, #34271e 13px 17px, transparent 18px 29px),\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, #86a4bb 0%, #d0a233 34%, #9b681c 65%, #4b3321 100%);\n    }\n    .polar {\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(174deg, #edf5fa 0 11px, #b5d5e7 12px 17px, #fbfdff 18px 29px, #6d9db8 30px 35px),\n        linear-gradient(to bottom, #587e99, #f8fbfc);\n    }\n    .polar:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 40px;\n      bottom: 29px;\n      width: 13px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: #dedfcf;\n      border-radius: 65% 45% 45% 55%;\n      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 -3px #565651;\n    }\n    figcaption {\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      color: #5b5146;\n      font-size: 11.5px;\n      line-height: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: -0.15px;\n    }\n    .number {\n      color: #16865a;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-right: 2px;\n    }\n    .cap-highlight {\n      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 27%, #efd1a7 27%, #efd1a7 91%, transparent 91%);\n    }\n    .figure-label {\n      margin: 4px 0 0 1px;\n      color: #656565;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 15px;\n    }\n    .lower-text {\n      width: 276px;\n      margin: 14px 0 0 142px;\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      text-align: justify;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 53px;\n      bottom: 42px;\n      color: #777;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 14px;\n    }\n    footer .page-no {\n      margin-right: 13px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <h1>世界气候类型的分布</h1>\n      <p class=\"intro\">\n        虽然世界的气候复杂多样（图3.27），但是它们的分布有一定规律。例如，<br>\n        <span class=\"highlight\">由赤道地区到极地地区，有规律地分布着热带的、亚热带的、温带的和寒带的<br>气候。</span>不同的气候类型呈现出不同的自然景观。\n      </p>\n\n      <section class=\"gallery\" aria-label=\"不同气候类型的自然景观\">\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder rainforest\"><span>[Photo: 热带雨林]</span></div>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"number\">①</span><span class=\"cap-highlight\">热带雨林气候主要分布在赤道附近地区，</span><br>\n            <span class=\"cap-highlight\">这里全年高温多雨，植物终年常绿，</span><br>\n            多地分布着茂密的热带雨林。\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder savanna\"><span>[Photo: 热带草原]</span></div>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"number\">②</span><span class=\"cap-highlight\">热带草原气候主要分布在热带雨林气候</span><br>\n            <span class=\"cap-highlight\">的南北两侧。这里终年高温，年内有明</span><br>\n            <span class=\"cap-highlight\">显的干季和雨季。地面上树木稀疏、长着</span><br>\n            较高的草。\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder forest\"><span>[Photo: 温带落叶阔叶林]</span></div>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"number\">③</span><span class=\"cap-highlight\">温带季风气候主要分布在温带地区的亚</span><br>\n            <span class=\"cap-highlight\">欧大陆东部。这里夏季高温、多雨，冬季寒</span><br>\n            <span class=\"cap-highlight\">冷、干燥。生长着落叶阔叶林。</span>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <figure>\n          <div class=\"placeholder polar\"><span>[Photo: 寒带冰原]</span></div>\n          <figcaption>\n            <span class=\"number\">④</span><span class=\"cap-highlight\">寒带气候主要分布在极圈以内，大部分</span><br>\n            <span class=\"cap-highlight\">地区是冰原，地面被厚厚的冰雪覆盖。</span>\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"figure-label\">图3.27&nbsp; 不同气候类型的自然景观</div>\n\n      <p class=\"lower-text\">\n        其中，热带的气候大致分布在南、北回归线之间，寒带的气候大致分布在南、北极圈内，亚热带和温带的气候大致分布在北回归线与北极圈、南回归线与南极圈之间。在中纬度地区，由大陆东岸、大陆西岸向大陆内部，气候类型的分布也是有规律的。\n      </p>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer><span class=\"page-no\">64</span>第三章　天气与气候</footer>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
